  ## Step 6 — Create a Registry Secret

  Code Engine needs credentials to pull from IBM Container Registry:

  ibmcloud ce secret create-registry \
    --name icr-secret \
    --server us.icr.io \
    --username iamapikey \
    --password "$(ibmcloud iam api-key-create interlock-pull-key --output json | python -c 'import sys,json; 
  print(json.load(sys.stdin)[\"apikey\"])')"

